# RandomInt, Timestamp, GUID Available for Generation.
# Hover on Variable to see it's value.


### List 

GET http://{{host}}:{{port}}/{{version}}/student?offset=0&limit={{limit}}&sort_by=name&order=asc

### Audit

GET http://{{host}}:{{port}}/{{version}}/student/1/audit

### Create
# @name createStudent
POST http://{{host}}:{{port}}/{{version}}/student
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Amanpreet Singh",
    "age": 31,
    "gender": "MALE"
}

### Get
@studentId= {{createStudent.response.body.$.id}}
GET http://{{host}}:{{port}}/{{version}}/student/{{studentId}}

### Update
@studentId= {{createStudent.response.body.$.id}}
PUT http://{{host}}:{{port}}/{{version}}/student/{{studentId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Amanpreet Singh",
    "age": 33,
    "gender": "MALE"
}

### Delete
# @prompt userId
DELETE http://{{host}}:{{port}}/{{version}}/student/{{userId}}

### Play
POST http://localhost:11434/api/generate
Content-Type: application/json

